# Custom recipe for Nvidia-Settings 580.159.04 (plain Makefile)
#
# Part of the Nvidia stack port.  Nvidia.
#
# nvidia-settings ships NO autotools configure -- it's a hand-rolled recursive
# Makefile (top-level Makefile just runs `$(MAKE) -C src/samples/doc`).
# PREFIX ?= /usr/local in utils.mk feeds BINDIR/LIBDIR/MANDIR, so this must be
# recipe_type=makefile with PREFIX=$target (the same pattern as Wlr-Protocols/
# Scdoc). GNU make forwards command-line vars down the recursive sub-makes via
# MAKEFLAGS, jansson is bundled by default (NV_USE_BUNDLED_LIBJANSSON ?= 1),
# and samples/install is a declared no-op "to satisfy top-level recursion".
#
# file_md5 + file_size taken from the ACTUAL tarball we verified on disk
# (nvidia-settings-580.159.04.tar.bz2, md5=03d34135815b1ab8905cf727b6d2b938, 1133196 bytes).

compile_version=017-GIT
